\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Pass me not, O gentle Saviour,
\par Hear my humble cry;
\par While on others Thou art calling,
\par Do not pass me by.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus \cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Saviour! Saviour! 
\par Hear my humble cry;
\par And while others Thou art calling,
\par Do not pass me by.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2
\par \cf0\ulnone\b0 2. Let me at a throne of mercy
\par Find a sweet relief;
\par Kneeling there in deep contrition,
\par Help my unbelief.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus \cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Saviour! Saviour! 
\par Hear my humble cry;
\par And while others Thou art calling,
\par Do not pass me by.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Trusting only in Thy merit,
\par Would I seek Thy face;
\par Heal my wounded, broken spirit,
\par Save me by Thy grace.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus \cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Saviour! Saviour! 
\par Hear my humble cry;
\par And while others Thou art calling,
\par Do not pass me by.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Thou the spring of all my comfort,
\par More than life to me,
\par Whom have I on earth beside Thee?
\par Whom in heaven but Thee?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus \cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Saviour! Saviour! 
\par Hear my humble cry;
\par And while others Thou art calling,
\par Do not pass me by.
\par \f1 
